  "description": "Would you rather be the target of a ruthless gang of loan sharks or become the boy-toy of an unhinged corporate heir for a year? This is the predicament Hojin finds himself in when Yoo-Seong, a former one-night stand, wrestles him into a deal that’ll solve all his money problems. He’ll have to pay a hefty price in return, but Hojin soon comes to learn that his cruel master for a year hides a rather lonely heart. Thus, the two begin to grow closer... Will they actually find comfort in each other or will this year crush Ho-Jin for good? \n\n(Source: Tappytoon) \n\n*Note: Includes 34 extra chapters.*",
